    "answer": "Based on the evidence, 41 of 44 reconciliation harness cases are passing. [Status update - week 38](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/evidence?item=cbe62fbc-1574-4496-8d39-996ab4117a78#evidence-cbe62fbc-1574-4496-8d39-996ab4117a78) states \"Quality: 41 of 44 reconciliation harness cases passing; 3 blocked on vendor fixtures.\"\n\nThe three failing cases are blocked on vendor fixtures. [Meridian status note](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/evidence?item=c892f171-ee2a-4233-a091-cd0129ffeb62#evidence-c892f171-ee2a-4233-a091-cd0129ffeb62) confirms this: Meridian Settlement Services lists \"Blocker: customer-side test fixtures\" for their reconciliation service deliverable. This is also tracked as task \"Vendor reconciliation fixtures\" which is assigned to Marcus Reyes in the Blocked status.",
