    "answer": "The pilot start date decision is resting on avoiding the finance reporting freeze. Finance asked for a reporting freeze from the first to the fifth of October, and the original pilot window started on the third, so the decision was made to move the pilot start to 2026-10-06 to clear this freeze. [Architecture review call](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/evidence?item=7a71e3e3-21a1-443b-afd3-5a74b1773d02#evidence-7a71e3e3-21a1-443b-afd3-5a74b1773d02)\n\nThe decision also rests on two assumptions: that the Pilot cut-over milestone keeps its 2026-10-06 due date, and that Nadia Rahman remains the named security reviewer. [D-3 Move the pilot start to 6 October to clear the finance reporting freeze](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=9ec5233b-fe9d-4c93-9643-d287adbedbb7)",
