    "answer": "According to the pilot runbook, three preconditions must be true before the cut-over starts: [Pilot runbook draft 2](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/evidence?item=0fa344a2-d64b-4a16-8cad-abfbe7a862ab#evidence-0fa344a2-d64b-4a16-8cad-abfbe7a862ab)\n\n1. A replication slot must be created on the legacy ledger with lag under five seconds for one hour.\n2. Eleven pilot merchants must be flagged in the merchant table.\n3. Nadia Rahman (the security reviewer) must be available for the security checkpoint at T+2 hours.",
